'' '#import' IN A SCAN: the modules are scanned front end only, and the imported module's
'' PUBLIC symbols hang under the root's alias -- a namespace at the '#import' line -- at
'' their TRUE position in the module's own source (not the interface's). A module only a
'' module imports is not the root's to see. Nothing is built, so no TKO0992, and the
'' module cache is neither read nor written: no '.tiko' beside the sources.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan -i tests/driver/src/modcache/libs tests/driver/src/modcache/app/main.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: [0] main.bas
'' EXPECT-OUT: namespace middle  @0:1:15  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: function Twice as long  @3:3:17  parent=2  body=3..5  flags=&h000
'' EXPECT-OUT: const LEAF_BASE as integer
'' EXPECT-OUT: diags: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: Seed
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0992
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/driver/src/modcache/app/.tiko
